1
00:00:18,021 --> 00:00:23,561
Bonjour, Marinette ! Qu'est-ce que tu regardes ?
Hello, Marinette! What are you looking at?

2
00:00:25,261 --> 00:00:30,657
Ma famille ! Regardez, c'est une photo.
My family! Look, it's a photo.

3
00:00:32,057 --> 00:00:34,429
Qui est-ce ?
Who is that?

4
00:00:34,529 --> 00:00:37,837
Voici ma mère et mon père.
Here are my mother and my father.

5
00:00:38,637 --> 00:00:41,993
Et la petite fille, c'est qui ?
And the little girl, who is she?

6
00:00:43,393 --> 00:00:48,237
C'est ma sœur. Elle s'appelle Sophie.
That's my sister. Her name is Sophie.

7
00:00:48,337 --> 00:00:50,853
Quel âge a-t-elle ?
How old is she?

8
00:00:50,953 --> 00:00:53,397
Elle a dix ans.
She is ten years old.

9
00:00:54,797 --> 00:00:59,161
Et ton frère ? Tu as un frère ?
And your brother? Do you have a brother?

10
00:01:00,561 --> 00:01:05,549
Non ! Mais j'ai un chat qui s'appelle Mochi.
No! But I have a cat called Mochi.

11
00:01:06,949 --> 00:01:11,481
Alors, le chat fait aussi partie de la famille !
So the cat is part of the family too!

12
00:01:12,981 --> 00:01:15,377
Bien sûr !
Of course!
